<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en"
      lang="en"
      metal:use-macro="here/main_template/macros/master"
      i18n:domain="senaite.sampleimporter">

<head>< i18n:translate=""
        tal:content="Add SampleImport"/>
</head>


<body>

<div metal:fill-slot="content-core">

    <h1>
        <img tal:attributes="src string:++resource++senaite.sampleimporter.static/img/sampleimport_big.png"/>
        <span i18n:translate="">Import Sample Data</span>
    </h1>

    <p><a tal:attributes="href string:${here/absolute_url}/sampleimport_template"
          >Download sample import spreadsheet (CSV)</a></p>
    <p>
        Fill in Contact with an existing client contact name and select analyses
        by entering 1 in their keyword columns. Save the spreadsheet as CSV.
    </p>
    <p>
        Mining sample columns: <code>MatrixReference</code>,
        <code>Shift</code>, <code>Classification</code>,
        <code>DrumBatch</code> and <code>TargetTAT</code>.
        Use existing lookup titles or UIDs. Target TAT is in hours;
        leave it blank to use the configured default. TAT Status is
        calculated when results are published.
    </p>

    <form method="post" name="import_analysisrequest" enctype="multipart/form-data">
        <input type="hidden" name="submitted" value="1" />
        <input type="hidden" name="ClientID" tal:attributes="value here/getId"/>
        <div class="field">
            <input id="sampleimport_file" type="file" name="csvfile" size="60"/>
        </div>
        <input
            class="context"
            type="submit"
            name="submit"
            value="Import"
            i18n:attributes="value"
        />
    </form>

</div>

</body>
</html>
